      <activity id="598f2842-cef1-509b-a1a2-82c470f00db5" activityNameId="026ae9b1-e6e5-52f5-bbee-2a376b093842" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Poor concrete, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Poor concrete, at plant
Part of total Swiss concrete production: insignificant. Density: 2'190 kg/m3. Ingredients: Cement 150 kg, Water 110 kg, Gravel 1'930 kg. Wastewater is an average from data on 11 German concrete mixing plant.;
Synonyms: Transportbeton, Magerbeton, ready mixed concrete, poor concrete; 
UUID: 3d6b3acb-a4ef-344a-adb1-fde0cbecaa69
includes the whole manufacturing processes to produce ready-mixed concrete, other internal processes (transport, etc.), and infrastructure (machines). No administration is included. Wastewater and some solid wastes are considered. No dust is accounted for.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Typical technology for average Swiss production
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Measured data of 6 Swiss plants 
Extrapolations: See geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3d6b3acb-a4ef-344a-adb1-fde0cbecaa69.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
